        "id": 1836235
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-05-30T15:10:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Tag value 1000 is in an IANA-controlled range (https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8949#section-9.2) that is \"assigned by Specification Required\" (https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8126#section-4.6).\n\nA value (\u003e32768, avoiding the ones already assigned in https://www.iana.org/assignments/cbor-tags/cbor-tags.xhtml) in the \"First Come First Served\" (https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8126#section-4.4) range would be preferable, along with a registration of the value.",
      "revId": "78851d3105862de5d079b27ea71e1270ba0c4de9",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4ac4cb25_c1b4f38b",
        "filename": "security/keymint/aidl/android/hardware/security/keymint/IKeyMintDevice.aidl",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 894,
      "author": {
        "id": 1043663
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-05-31T20:12:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Registration is clearly not necessary. The reasons for this tag are to prevent confusion if we decide to apply the auth token HMAC key to some other COSE_Mac0, and for versioning.  I suppose it\u0027s reasonable to use the first-come-first-served range.  I\u0027ll pick 40000 + version number.",
      "parentUuid": "8a844676_b6fc3161",
      "revId": "78851d3105862de5d079b27ea71e1270ba0c4de9",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
